1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,627
Pink Shell Beach Resort, on Fort Myers
Beach, looks perfect on paper. But one
line in the fine print changes your bill.

2
00:00:08,077 --> 00:00:14,249
A four star resort, right on the sand, and
the most searched resort in ten states, in
one study.

3
00:00:14,899 --> 00:00:19,697
Fourteen hundred and ninety four guests
rate it nine point four out of ten.

4
00:00:21,147 --> 00:00:24,390
It has one hundred ninety five rooms, and
three pools.

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,312
It has three restaurants, and three bars.

6
00:00:29,762 --> 00:00:31,674
And the airport is forty three minutes
away.

7
00:00:34,433 --> 00:00:38,584
First, what's worth your time. And stay
until the end, for the honest score.

8
00:00:40,083 --> 00:00:50,844
The beach comes first. The resort sits
right on the Gulf, with its own marina,
kayaks and paddleboards. Then the pools:
three outdoor pools, two hot tubs, and a
bar by the water.

9
00:00:51,344 --> 00:01:01,159
The room to book is the Deluxe Gulf Front
Studio. Two queen beds, three hundred
seventy six square feet, a balcony, a
fridge, and breakfast included with that
rate.

10
00:01:01,659 --> 00:01:08,137
For food, Jack's is the lunch spot, and
Rae's Real Italian is the Italian
restaurant. The beach bar is Bob's.

11
00:01:09,033 --> 00:01:10,750
Now, what does it really cost?

12
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:16,405
Included, says the listing: valet parking,
WiFi, and phone calls.

13
00:01:16,905 --> 00:01:21,689
Not included: a late check out, and an
extra bed. Both cost extra.

14
00:01:22,189 --> 00:01:34,631
And the hidden part: a daily resort fee,
plus a deposit at check in. The amount
changes from one booking site to another,
so check the total with the fee, before
you compare it with the hotel next door.

15
00:01:35,533 --> 00:01:37,959
So, what do guests really say?

16
00:01:39,450 --> 00:01:41,137
Here's what's behind that score.

17
00:01:41,637 --> 00:01:43,923
What guests love: it's very clean.

18
00:01:44,423 --> 00:01:45,760
The location is great.

19
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:48,056
And it's perfect for little kids.

20
00:01:48,556 --> 00:01:51,962
What they complain about: rates run high
in peak season.

21
00:01:52,462 --> 00:01:53,739
Parking can be tight.

22
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:57,563
And noise depends on your room, with
construction next door.

23
00:01:59,017 --> 00:02:03,867
Now, the don't list. Don't book before you
see the total with the resort fee.

24
00:02:04,367 --> 00:02:07,875
Don't take a room without asking where the
construction is.

25
00:02:08,375 --> 00:02:13,896
And don't expect a quiet pool everywhere.
One guest says the calm one is the adults
only pool.

26
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,462
Now, where is it exactly?

27
00:02:17,983 --> 00:02:22,275
The nearest airport is Southwest Florida
International, forty three minutes by car.

28
00:02:22,775 --> 00:02:26,672
The resort is on Estero Boulevard, the
main road of Fort Myers Beach.

29
00:02:27,172 --> 00:02:30,938
Taxi and shuttle prices aren't listed, so
ask the resort before you land.

30
00:02:31,438 --> 00:02:35,152
Around the hotel, Bowditch Point Park is a
two minute walk.

31
00:02:35,652 --> 00:02:38,331
Lynn Hall Memorial Park is five minutes on
foot.

32
00:02:38,831 --> 00:02:42,052
And the long beach strip is seventeen
minutes on foot.

33
00:02:43,567 --> 00:02:44,627
When should you go?

34
00:02:46,117 --> 00:02:49,014
The driest months run from November to
April.

35
00:02:49,514 --> 00:02:54,568
From June to September, it's hot and
rainy, with thunderstorms most afternoons.

36
00:02:55,068 --> 00:03:01,255
Hurricane season runs from June first to
November thirtieth, so read the
cancellation policy before you book.

37
00:03:01,755 --> 00:03:08,296
A good compromise is mid April to May:
warm, drier, and after the spring break
crowds.

38
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,160
And now, the verdict.

39
00:03:12,650 --> 00:03:18,753
It's great for families, couples, and
anyone who wants the beach at the door.

40
00:03:19,253 --> 00:03:24,380
It's not for anyone who needs silence, or
who budgets without the resort fee.

41
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:27,015
The honest score: eight out of ten.

42
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:36,266
That was the Pink Shell Beach Resort.
Which hotel should we check out next? Tell
me in the comments.
